 "about_item": "【Soft Fabric】This women's plus size tops is made of 95% polyester & 5% spandex, made of real soft, lightweight and stretchy fabric. It won't shrink, fade or cling, machine washable. It's stretchy and super soft against the skin, makes you wear comfortable all day.   【Variation Pattern】TIYOMI Womens plus size shirt crew neck with color block design long sleeve tops with multiple pattern (Leopard/Camo/Floral/Zebra/Sequins) Stylish patterns and color combinations makes you more fashion and charming & fit for the upper arm.   【Easy to Pair】TIYOMI Casual plus size long sleeve tops will be perfect for your favorite pair of jeans, skinny legging, boot or wear under a cardigan/coat/jacket, in any occation. It's perfect for vacation, dating, daily wear, and also for maternity top. Perfect for Fall and Winter!!   【True to Size】From XL to 5XL, loose enough, perfect women plus size long sleeve tunices for fuller figures. Please check our size chart for more size detail and choose your size refer to the size information.   【Washing Instruction & Customer service】These tops hand wash were recommended, machine wash is also acceptable.Do not bleach. Do not hang or line dry.TIYOMI specialize & develop fashionable and comfortable plus-size women's clothing. Customer always is our priority, please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any issue during the transaction.",
